[l_english.STATE_LORE_772]
Peaks of Peril has the oldest civilization in Kirin history: even though it is not always the capital of Kirin civilization, even though it has been destroyed countless times, it has never lacked Kirins living here.
Not long ago, Rain Shine became the leader of Peaks of Peril, developed and utilized the water of the Stream of Silence, and established a prosperous community here through the “Silence”. Rain Shine’s success quickly spread throughout the entire Kirin tribe, and Peaks of Peril once again, as history has repeatedly proven, became the center of Kirin civilization.
Then, the emerging leader Autumn Blaze, the “Silence” ended. Peaks of Peril, near the port, also naturally became the first group of cities to open up to the outside world and trade. Now, it is not only administration that maintains its capital status, but also trade and industry.

[l_english.STATE_LORE_772_0]
Duan Shan, formerly known as “Peaks of Peril”, has the oldest civilization in Kirin history: even though it is not always the capital of Kirin civilization, even though it has been destroyed countless times, it has never lacked Kirins living here — until the appearance of the last Kirin leader, Autumn Blaze.
Under Autumn Blaze’s leadership, the Kirins began to open up to the outside world. The colorful outside world made the Kirins lost in it, they were tempted by Sendak, and fell into the abyss of dark magic. In the end, the arrogant Kirins attracted Tirek’s attention, and in a world-destroying war — or perhaps a unilateral massacre, Peaks of Peril was razed to the ground, the mountain was split in two, and became what nowaday called Duan Shan, Broken Mountain.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_772]
险崇峰拥有着麒麟历史上最古老的文明：即使很多时候这里并不是麒麟文明的首都，即使这里也无数次遭遇毁灭，但从未缺少过麒麟在此处生活。
不久前，雨晴成为了险崇峰的领袖，开发利用了静默溪的溪水，通过“静默”在这里建立了一个繁荣的社群。雨晴的成功很快被扩散到了整个麒麟族，险崇峰也又一次，如历史上反复证明的那样，成为了麒麟文明的中心。
直到新兴领袖秋烨出现，“静默”才得以结束。邻近港口的险崇峰也顺利成章成为了第一批对外开放和贸易的城市，如今，保持其首都地位的已经不止是行政，还有贸易和工业。

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_772_0]
断山又名“险崇峰”，拥有着麒麟历史上最古老的文明：即使很多时候这里并不是麒麟文明的首都，即使这里也无数次遭遇毁灭，但从未缺少过麒麟在此处生活 —— 直到最后一任麒麟领袖秋烨的出现。
在秋烨的领导下，麒麟开始了对外的开放。灯红酒绿的外界世界让麒麟们迷失其中，他们受到僧达克的蛊惑，堕入黑魔法的深渊。最终，狂妄自大的麒麟招来了提雷克的注意，在一场毁天灭地的战争中 —— 或许是单方面的屠杀中，险崇峰被夷为平地，山体一分为二，成为了如今的断山。
